// Episode level 1. Coordinates in metres, x = east, y = north, z = up.
// Route: rooftop (start, z 12; helipad with a wrecked chopper, 3 sleeping Grunts) → east into the
// stairwell: down the first flight to the landing (shotgun, a breakable lamp) → down the second
// flight (2 Enforcers) → the foot → door south into the street. Alternative: hop the fire escape
// south-east of the roof (ledges z 6 and 3, shells, a Drone) and drop onto the street.
// Street (a burning car and a crashed van, planters, a bus stop, a lamp post, the newsstand on the
// north sidewalk; barrels, Grunts, Slashers, Drones): the grate mid-street fires channel 1,
// opening the two shop fronts on the north side (awake Grunts) → the theater canopy → either
// lobby door → the entrance strip fires channel 2: two cloakrooms in the lobby's south wall open
// (an awake Enforcer and Grunt) → lobby (concession counter, pillars, vending machine, restroom
// with a toilet, medkit) → stairs up to the manager's office on the mezzanine (red key, a
// Slasher; window-height walls) → back down the stairs → red door in the east wall → auditorium:
// up the entry steps to the rear aisle, down the centre aisle between the seat rows (Grunts
// behind seat backs; the balcony 2 m above, reached by the lift by the rear aisle) → front aisle
// → stage steps → stage (a Slasher) → door in the stage's east wall → backstage → exit switch on
// the east wall.
// Secrets: (1) a crouch vent in the roof's north wall at x 26-30 into the roof hut (armour);
// (2) the scorched alley wall at x 90 behind the barrel cracks open on a blast: stash (atom,
// rockets); (3) a crouch gap in the balcony's north wall into the projection booth (medkit, atom).
// Built by `rr-tools build` from levels/src/hollywood_meltdown.ron. Do not edit; edit the source and rebuild.
